{title: All Creation Sing}
{artist: Arien Polumbarit}
{category: Worship Song}
{key: A}
{tempo: 105}
{youtube: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kotCEmdrb9o&pp=ygUfYWxsIGNyZWF0aW9uIHNpbmcgZmVhc3Qgd29yc2hpcA%3D%3D}
Intro:
[A]  [A]  [D]  [D]  [F#m]  [E]  [D]  [D]
{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[A]God of my past, God of my [D]present and future
[A]Unbounded by time, unchanging [D]forever and ever.
[F#m]Let every breath declare [E]all your glory and [D]power
[F#m]Let every voice sing of [E]your praises for[D]ever
{end_of_verse}
{start_of_chorus: Chorus 1}
[A]From the mountains peak To the valleys low
[D]From the ends of the earth All creation sing
[F#m]Halle - [E]lujah. [D]Halle - lujah
{end_of_chorus}
{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[A]Great is your love as vast as the [D]seas and the oceans
[A]My heart in your hands the same hand that [D]crafted the heavens
[F#m]The word at the start, you took [E]the form of cre[D]ation
[F#m]Your mighty name, Jesus, [E]Your name is sal[D]vation
{end_of_verse}
{start_of_chorus: Chorus 1}
[A]From the mountains peak To the valleys low
[D]From the ends of the earth All creation sing
[F#m]Halle - [E]lujah. [D]Halle - lujah
{end_of_chorus}
{start_of_chorus: Chorus 2}
[A]From the skies above To the depths below
[D]Every season and time All creation sing
[F#m]Halle - [E]lujah. [D]Halle - lujah
{end_of_chorus}
{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
With [E]all I am, and all I [F#m]have I [D]sing to You for all You've done
With [E]everything, I lift my [D]Halle[A]lujah
While [E]I have breath, while I have [F#m]life I'll [D]sing until Your eyes meet mine
And [E]even then, I lift my [D]Halle[A]lujah
{end_of_bridge}
